        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 130962,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Enum'lar veya <em>numaralandırmalar</em>, adlandırılmış sabitlerden oluşan bir kümeye daha anlaşılır adlar verir. <code>enum</code> anahtar kelimesiyle başlarız.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"enum\" class=\"keyword\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"4\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>enum</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2 - Copy",
            "id": 131073,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ardından enum için bir adın yanı sıra açma ve kapatma süslü parantezlerine de ihtiyacımız var.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"enum\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Directions {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"5\" endIndex=\"15\" /><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>Directions</code>, ardından <code>{</code> ve son olarak <code>}</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3 - Copy",
            "id": 131074,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Son olarak, süslü parantezlerin içindeki değerleri virgülle ayırarak ekleriz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"enum\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Directions {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Up,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Down,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Left,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Right\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"22\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>Up,</code>, ardından <code>,</code> ve son olarak <code>,</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 130963,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>TypeScript'te bir enum'un her üyesine <code>0</code>'dan başlayarak otomatik olarak bir sayı atanır.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"enum\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Directions {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Up,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Down,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Left,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Right\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(Directions.Up);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"0\" /></content></output></code></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 130964,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Enum üyelerinin değerini manuel olarak ayarlayabiliriz. Bunu yalnızca ilk üye için yapmamız gerekir; diğerlerinin değeri otomatik olarak artırılır.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"enum\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Directions {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Up = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Down,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Left,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Right\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(Directions.Up);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(Directions.Down);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(Directions.Left);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(Directions.Right);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"25\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"5\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"6\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"7\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"8\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>=</code>, ardından <code>5</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 130965,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tersi yönde de çalışır. TypeScript'teki enum'lar nesnedir. Bu nedenle bir enum üyesinin adını değerinden de alabilirsin.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"enum\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Directions {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Up = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Down,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Left,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Right\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(Directions[\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"74\" endIndex=\"75\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Up\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Up\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>1</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 130966,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>TypeScript'te enum nedir?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Bir sayısal değerler kümesine daha anlaşılır adlar vermenin bir yolu</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Adlandırılmış sabitler kümesi</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Bir sayısal değerler kümesine daha anlaşılır adlar vermenin bir yolu.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 130970,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>enum bildirimini tamamla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"enum\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Days {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Monday,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Tuesday,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Wednesday,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Thursday,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Friday,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Saturday,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Sunday\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"4\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>enum</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 130968,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu, konsolda ne görüntüler?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"enum\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Months {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Jan = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Feb,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Mar,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Apr\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(Months.Mar);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>3</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>Mar</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>3</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 130967,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>TypeScript'te enum tanımlamanın doğru yollarından hangisi budur?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>enum Directions { Up, Down, Left, Right };</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>enumerate Directions { Up, Down, Left, Right };</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>enum Directions { Up, Down, Left, Right };</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
