            "id": 130974,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Otomatik artan sayılar yerine dize değerlerini de kullanabiliriz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"enum\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" MusicGenres {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Classical = \" /><text value=\"&quot;CLASSICAL&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Rock = \" /><text value=\"&quot;ROCK&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Pop = \" /><text value=\"&quot;POP&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Jazz = \" /><text value=\"&quot;JAZZ&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"43\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>Classical</code>, ardından <code>=</code> ve son olarak <code>\"CLASSICAL\"</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 130975,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu enum'un değerini yazdırırsak, dize değeri konsolda gösterilir.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"enum\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" MusicGenres {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Classical = \" /><text value=\"&quot;CLASSICAL&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Rock = \" /><text value=\"&quot;ROCK&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Pop = \" /><text value=\"&quot;POP&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Jazz = \" /><text value=\"&quot;JAZZ&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(MusicGenres.Classical);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"105\" endIndex=\"116\" /><option startIndex=\"117\" endIndex=\"126\" /><option startIndex=\"116\" endIndex=\"117\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;CLASSICAL&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"CLASSICAL\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>MusicGenres</code>, ardından <code>.</code> ve son olarak <code>Classical</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 130976,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tek bir enum hem sayıları hem de dizeleri depolayabilir. Bir sayı ve bir dize depolayan bir enum oluşturalım.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"enum\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Options {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Yes = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" No = \" /><text value=\"&quot;NO&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(Options.Yes);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(Options.No);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"35\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"NO\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>1</code>, ardından <code>\"NO\"</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 130978,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu kodun çıktısı nedir?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"enum\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Status {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  Active = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  Inactive = \" /><text value=\"&quot;INACTIVE&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(Status.Active);\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"1\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">1</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">ETKİSİZ</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">1 öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
